WEBVTT

00:00:01.604 --> 00:00:07.018
A chip giant just bought the home of open models for 17.5 trillion won.

00:00:07.018 --> 00:00:11.028
What? We were supposed to move in this month.

00:00:11.028 --> 00:00:16.864
Open never meant no landlord. It meant an invisible one.

00:00:16.864 --> 00:00:21.033
The download stays free. Everything after is on my meter.

00:00:21.033 --> 00:00:26.400
Just deploy more agents! I'll go check if it is still open!

00:00:28.051 --> 00:00:33.198
We are back. The models copied themselves and left.

00:00:35.069 --> 00:00:41.085
Our models live in our own house. The news cannot reach them.

